0 FILE 10218 - Blue House 1 Basement.ldr
0 Pet-shop basement and yard on a green baseplate, with tiled and bricked walls and a staircase, housing animals (dog, cat, rat, parrot, fish, frog), a bone, bucket, treasure chest, cupboard with money, telescope, glazed windscreen, hinged control stick and assorted container boxes
0 Name: 10218 - Blue House 1 Basement.ldr
0 Author: Stefan Frenz (smf)
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
